## Secrets & Config
## NOTE: appsettings.Production.json is intentionally tracked — it contains no real secrets,
## only blank placeholders that document which settings must be supplied via environment
## variables at deploy time. Never put actual secret values in it.
appsettings.Secrets.json
secrets.json
.env

