## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Migrations: Designer.cs files are part of each migration's identity and are REQUIRED for
## `dotnet ef database update` to work correctly for anyone else who clones this repo (or for
## a CI/CD pipeline). Do not ignore them — EF Core will silently produce broken/incomplete
## migrations without them.

